---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout title="About CareBridge Health – Medical Tourism Facilitator">
  <main class="container mx-auto px-5 py-12 max-w-4xl">
    <h1 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-bold mb-4">About CareBridge Health</h1>
    <p class="text-slate-600 text-lg mb-6">
      CareBridge Health is a medical travel coordination service that helps
      international patients access safe, high-quality treatment in India.
      We are not a hospital – we act as your bridge between home and trusted
      healthcare providers.
    </p>

    <section class="mb-8 space-y-3 text-slate-600">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold">Our Role</h2>
      <p>
        We work with a small, curated network of hospitals, clinics and
        specialists that meet strict quality, safety and communication
        standards. Our team helps you understand your options, compare
        treatment plans and organise your trip end-to-end.
      </p>
      <ul class="list-disc list-inside space-y-1">
        <li>Pre-screening of your case and reports</li>
        <li>Getting opinions and quotes from partner hospitals</li>
        <li>Scheduling, logistics and documentation support</li>
        <li>Local assistance during your stay in India</li>
      </ul>
    </section>

    <section class="mb-8 space-y-3 text-slate-600">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold">What We Focus On</h2>
      <ul class="list-disc list-inside space-y-1">
        <li>Hair transplant and hair restoration</li>
        <li>Dental implants and cosmetic dentistry</li>
        <li>Cosmetic & plastic surgery (selected procedures)</li>
      </ul>
    </section>

    <section class="bg-slate-50 rounded-xl p-6 md:p-8 mb-8">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold mb-2">Transparency & Limitations</h2>
      <p class="text-slate-600">
        We are not doctors and we do not replace medical advice. All clinical
        decisions are made by licensed healthcare professionals. Our job is to
        make your journey smoother, safer and more organised, with clear
        communication and no hidden surprises.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section class="text-slate-600">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold mb-3">Talk to Our Team</h2>
      <p class="mb-4">
        If you’re considering treatment in India, send us your basic details
        and reports. We’ll respond with next steps and what information is
        needed for a proper medical opinion.
      </p>
      <a
        href="https://wa.me/919080553616"
        target="_blank"
        rel="noopener"
        class="inline-flex items-center justify-center px-6 py-3 rounded bg-blue-600 text-white font-medium hover:bg-blue-700"
      >
        Message Us on WhatsApp
      </a>
    </section>
  </main>
</Layout>
